  "result": "Fixed in `src/click/core.py` (`Context.__init__`). A child context inherited the parent's whole `default_map` instead of the entry for its own command name, so `{'sub': {'x': 'mapped'}}` was never looked up under `sub`. It now uses `parent.default_map.get(info_name)`.\n\nI checked it with a group and a `sub` command that has `--x default='orig'`, invoked with `default_map={'sub': {'x': 'mapped'}}`. It now prints `mapped`. The full suite passes (1912 passed, 102 skipped, 1 xfailed). I didn't add a regression test.",
